sequenceDiagram
  participant Jobs
  participant Scanner
  participant Steam
  participant Files as Level parser
  participant DB as Database persistence
  participant Store as Object storage
  Jobs->>Scanner: Scan requested workshop items
  Scanner->>Steam: Download accessible items
  Steam-->>Scanner: Downloaded directories and cleanup handle
  Scanner->>Files: Discover and parse .zeeplevel files
  Files-->>Scanner: Parsed levels and thumbnails
  Scanner->>DB: Upsert level and workshop item metadata
  Scanner->>Store: Upload thumbnail assets
  Scanner->>DB: Mark missing files deleted after successful scan
  Scanner->>Steam: Clean temporary download
  Scanner-->>Jobs: Changed IDs and transient failures
